n)=1)\\land\\forall n\\in B\\ (X(n)=0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sep}(A,B):=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in A\\ (X(n)=1)\\land\\forall n\\in B\\ (X(n)=0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分离集必须包含A并避开B；其余位置自由。有效闭性另由对应命题给出。</p>\n<p>来源：Example 5.16.2, print p.62 / PDF p.82。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A\\cap B=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sep}(A,B):=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in A\\ (X(n)=1)\\land\\forall n\\in B\\ (X(n)=0)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":907,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-separating-class]] — 不交枚举集的分离类"},{"id":"7e3484b94f13a4f9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sep}$、$\\operatorname{CE}$、$\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-separating-class]]、[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-pi01class]]。"}],"outgoing":["565c3258eee2a5ff"]}